From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:09:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2017/3799] soh: rename func_808B4C30 ->
 BgSpot16Bombstone_SplitParams

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: pulls the switch flag out of the high byte of params and leaves the type in the low byte
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c   | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
index 0b6f76958..b29076731 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
@@ -143,7 +143,8 @@ static f32 D_808B6074[] = { 66.0f, 51.0f, 48.0f, 36.0f, 21.0f };
 
 static s16 D_808B6088[] = { 0, 1, 2, 3, 4 };
 
-void func_808B4C30(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B4C30: pulls the switch flag out of the high byte of params and leaves the type in the low byte
+void BgSpot16Bombstone_SplitParams(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
     this->switchFlag = (this->actor.params >> 8) & 0x3F;
     this->actor.params = this->actor.params & 0xFF;
 }
@@ -233,7 +234,7 @@ void BgSpot16Bombstone_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     BgSpot16Bombstone* this = (BgSpot16Bombstone*)thisx;
     s16 shouldLive;
 
-    func_808B4C30(this);
+    BgSpot16Bombstone_SplitParams(this);  // was func_808B4C30 [LLM:HIGH]
 
     switch (this->actor.params) {
         case 0xFF:
